136	          </h2>
137	          <p className="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
138	            Free to start. Upgrade when your page count grows. Cancel anytime.
139	          </p>
140	
141	          <div className="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
142	            <Label htmlFor="billing-toggle" className={cn("text-sm", !isAnnual && "font-semibold text-foreground")}>
